# Play test of Crowfield Farm (CIPlay crowfield_farm, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The farmyard on the north plain (3.2 m): the farmhouse at -12 28 (its note by the door at -19 27), the barn x 4.5..15
# z 22.5..33 (the tack chest inside), the pen x -27..-18 z 28..35, the fields at x -26..-12; the goats on the hill's south side.
island Crowfield Farm
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Three Goats
wait 5
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Chicken 4
walk 0 40 to 0 34 to 0 27 h=3.2
zone farmyard
expect step 1
read Farmer's note
expect step 2
open Marta's basket
expect message FOR WHOEVER BRINGS THE GOATS HOME
open Barn tack chest
expect step 3
catch Goat 3
expect step 4
open Marta's basket
expect done
open Windmill box
open Feed bin
